l,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_NO_WAIT"],"不需等候",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwji-5Obu9KWAxUUa_UHHeVKBIIQ3YcHCKgBKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwji-5Obu9KWAxUUa_UHHeVKBIIQ3IcHCKcBKAk",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["咖哩飯等候時間非常久。另外，我想要索取番茄醬時，一位穿綠色制服的馬來西亞籍員工卻表示店內沒有番茄醬。但實際上，我看到其他點薯條的客人都有提供番茄醬。\n\n如果番茄醬僅提供給薯條餐點，應該直接告知「番茄醬僅搭配薯條提供，無法搭配其他餐點」，而不是直接說沒有番茄醬，這讓人感覺像是在欺騙顧客。\n\n這次的用餐體驗讓我非常失望，也感到很不愉快。\n\nThe curry rice took an extremely long time to be served. In addition, when I asked for ketchup, a Malaysian staff member wearing a green uniform told me that there was no ketchup available. However, I could clearly see that other customers who ordered French fries were given ketchup.\n\nIf ketchup is only provided with French fries, the staff should have explained that it cannot be served with other menu items, rather than saying there was no ketchup at all. It felt dishonest and misleading.\n\nOverall, I am very disappointed with this dining experience.",null,[0,143]]]],[null,1782110070000000,1782110070000000,"2 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfcmt1QUYyYTV5QlR4MVFUeFRIX0VzUQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfcmt1QUYyYTV5QlR4MVFUeFRIX0VzURoTQ2d3STlxN2owUVlRb0kybXdnRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwji-5Obu9KWAxUUa_UHHeVKBIIQ_2MIqQEoCg"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2102257802546192492/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3ZVdFeVdrdGhia3A2WVROS00xTXdZekpYV0doU1pVTXhUMWt4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2102257802546192492/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3ZVdFeVdrdGhia3A2WVROS00xTXdZekpYV0doU1pVTXhUMWt4UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2102257802546192492/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3ZVdFeVdrdGhia3A2WVROS00xTXdZekpYV0doU1pVTXhUMWt4UlJBQhAA",[